WEBVTT

00:08:27.962 --> 00:08:30.047
and he just shoved me right in the chest.

00:08:30.089 --> 00:08:31.799
"Come on, Alex."

00:08:31.799 --> 00:08:33.092
Then he shoved me again.

00:08:33.092 --> 00:08:35.010
"Come on, you can do better than that."

00:08:36.387 --> 00:08:39.807
Then he did something
that changed my recovery completely.

00:08:40.849 --> 00:08:42.643
He handed me a football.

00:08:43.435 --> 00:08:44.645
You see,

00:08:44.645 --> 00:08:48.440
after spending years and years
of my life with a football in my hands,

00:08:48.482 --> 00:08:50.859
I hadn't touched one
for months since my injury.

00:08:51.944 --> 00:08:54.572
It was like reattaching a lost limb.

00:08:55.155 --> 00:08:57.408
He told me to throw from one knee.

00:08:57.908 --> 00:08:59.868
I zipped one to him.

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:01.579
A better kind of spiral.